# Port strategy (canonical)

**Read:** [`.cursor/reports/c-to-js-port-strategy.md`](../reports/c-to-js-port-strategy.md)

**Handoff:** [`.cursor/reports/c-to-js-port-current.md`](../reports/c-to-js-port-current.md) — next batch only.

## Non-negotiable

1. **One batch = one C function / call graph** — not the next N RNG indices on a locator session.
2. **Oracle before peel** — update [`c-oracles/`](../reports/c-oracles/) before adding `_*LikeC` flags.
3. **Peel moratorium** — no new `_wizD1CommaPostTwentyFifth+` peels; run `bash tools/port-batch-gate.sh` before commit.
4. **Shrink harness** — prefer deleting peel bands over adding PostNth arms.
5. **Moveloop canaries** — `seed8000` 2900–3129, `seed0077` 3180–3242, `seed0102` full after `monmove`/`moveloop_*` edits.

Score is regression only — [port-from-c-not-score.mdc](port-from-c-not-score.mdc).
